<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Section 1.01&nbsp;<font style="text-transform: none"><b>Definitions</b></font><b>.</b>
The following terms when used in this Agreement have the meanings specified or referred to in this <u>Article I</u> (in addition to the
