<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">(a)&nbsp;Subject
to the terms and conditions set forth herein, ZONE shall contribute to the Company an aggregate amount of $100,000,000 in cash (the &#8220;<b>Initial
