<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">(h)&nbsp;<b>No
Material Adverse Change in ZONE.</b> There shall have been no material adverse change in ZONE&#8217;s business, balance sheet, listing
