<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Section 7.03&nbsp;<font style="text-transform: none"><b>Conditions
to Obligations of All Parties</b></font><b>.</b> The respective obligations of each JV Party to consummate the transactions contemplated
