X</font> &mdash; MISCELLANEOUS</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Section 10.01&nbsp;<font style="text-transform: none"><b>Expenses</b></font>.
