<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Section 10.06&nbsp;<FONT STYLE="text-transform: none"><B>Amendment
and Modification</B></FONT>. This Agreement may only be amended, modified, or supplemented by an agreement in writing signed by each JV
