<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Section 10.10&nbsp;<font style="text-transform: none"><b>Successors
and Assigns</b></font>. This Agreement shall be binding upon and shall inure to the benefit of the parties hereto and their respective
